  "description": "HDA nginx access logs via Victoria Logs (team=access, service.name=hda, job=nginx_hda). Use status dropdown (field status), not status=200 in the path filter.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Filter help (Victoria Logs / nginx JSON fields)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Defaults:** `filter=.*` (all paths), `status=.*` (all statuses), `search=.*`.\n\n| Variable | Applied as | Examples |\n|---|---|---|\n| **filter** | `path:~\"\u2026\"` **or** `request:~\"\u2026\"` | `.*`, `/collections`, `GET ` |\n| **status** | `status:~\"\u2026\"` on field `status` | `.*`, `200`, `206`, `404` \u2014 **not** `status=200` free text |\n| **search** | `request:~\"\u2026\"` | free regex on full request line |\n\nUseful fields: `client_ip`, `status`, `path`, `method`, `request`, `response_size`, `request_time`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Data Access Logs",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Logs",
      "description": "Formatted access lines: client_ip, status, method, path, response_size, request_time.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource",
        "uid": "victoria-logs"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showTime": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "wrapLogMessage": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource",
            "uid": "victoria-logs"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "team:=\"access\" \"service.name\":=\"hda\" job:=\"nginx_hda\" (path:~\"$filter\" or request:~\"$filter\") status:~\"$status\" request:~\"$search\" | format \"<client_ip> <status> <method> <path> bytes=<response_size> t=<request_time>s | <request>\" | sort by (_time) desc",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A",
          "maxLines": 500,
          "direction": "backward"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Aggregates",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Sum of total bytes per client",
      "description": "stats by (client_ip) sum(response_size) \u2014 queryType=stats (not instant).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource",
        "uid": "victoria-logs"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "total_bytes",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "filterable": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "client_ip"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 160
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "collection"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 180
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource",
            "uid": "victoria-logs"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "team:=\"access\" \"service.name\":=\"hda\" job:=\"nginx_hda\" (path:~\"$filter\" or request:~\"$filter\") status:~\"$status\" request:~\"$search\" | client_ip:~\".+\" | stats by (client_ip) sum(response_size) bytes",
          "queryType": "stats",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "labelsToFields",
          "options": {
            "mode": "columns"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "detected_level": true,
              "Line": true,
              "id": true,
              "labels": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "client_ip": 0,
              "Value": 1
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "total_bytes"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "fields": {},
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "total_bytes",
                "desc": true
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
